luable cards, and keeps control on my side rather than passing to my distant teammate.\n\nReason:\nI should play ♠8 because: (1) The Landlord is dangerously close to winning with only 7 cards, so I need to maintain control and pressure; (2) ♠8 is my lowest card that beats ♦4, making it the most efficient use of resources; (3) My teammate has 16 cards and is far from winning, so it\'s better for me to control the pace; (4) I preserve my powerful cards (pairs of 2s, pairs of J and 9, and BlackJoker) for critical moments when I need bombs or to win control back.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠8"]}'}
